  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2fc9a8ff-2364-4204-8885-2d02c1f37270-image.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 164px;\" /><br /><br />Both the weight will produce torques in opposite directions,<br /><br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#964;</mi><mi>net</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;(where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math>moment if inertia about axis of rotation)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>l</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>l</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mrow><mn>13</mn><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
